<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 764 MLN OF POLISH BONDS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 764 MLN OF POLISH BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 585 million</p>
<p>zlotys of Polish 16-percent two-year bonds and for 179 million</p>
<p>zlotys of 12-percent five-year bonds at the treasury's joint</p>
<p>800 million zloty primary tender, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
